  "title": "Gigantes (Greek Lima Beans)",
  "description": "This Greek gigantes recipe uses dried lima beans, canned chopped tomatoes, fresh garlic, and fresh dill to make a tasty side dish.",
  "authors": [
    "stamarex"
  ],
